## PR 1 — الأساس الإجباري

### Phase 1 — DB Migration

#### [NEW] `supabase/migrations/XXXXXX_merchant_decision_fields.sql`

```sql
-- Add merchant decision tracking fields
ALTER TABLE public.orders
  ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS merchant_decision_status TEXT
    CHECK (merchant_decision_status IN ('pending', 'accepted', 'rejected')),
  ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS merchant_rejection_reason_code TEXT NULL,
  ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS merchant_decision_at TIMESTAMPTZ NULL,
  ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS merchant_decision_by UUID NULL;

-- Backfill existing orders safely:
-- Orders still 'new' → pending (awaiting merchant decision)
-- All other orders → accepted (already processed)
UPDATE public.orders
SET merchant_decision_status =
  CASE
    WHEN status = 'new' THEN 'pending'
    ELSE 'accepted'
  END
WHERE merchant_decision_status IS NULL;

-- Set default for new orders
ALTER TABLE public.orders
  ALTER COLUMN merchant_decision_status SET DEFAULT 'pending';

-- Index for merchant filtering
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_orders_merchant_decision_status
  ON public.orders(merchant_id, merchant_decision_status);
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Backfill آمن:** الطلبات القديمة بحالة `delivered`, `preparing`, `shipped`, `returned` تصبح `accepted` تلقائياً. فقط الطلبات التي `status = 'new'` تبقى `pending`.

